# Ansible
# This repo ships the shape of a deployment, not anyone's actual servers.
# Committed:  playbook.yml, roles/, the *.example files, and the README.
# Ignored:    your own inventory, your own settings, your own passwords.
#
# Keep your filled-in copies in a private git repo, host_vars vault-encrypted,
# see ansible/README.md. scripts/import-host-vars.sh rebuilds host_vars/<host>.yml
# from a running server, so a lost laptop is recoverable as long as the servers
# are alive.
ansible/inventory.yml
ansible/group_vars/all/main.yml
ansible/host_vars/*.yml
ansible/*.retry
# Keep the templates, they carry no secrets
!ansible/**/*.example

